t multi-turn growth signals exist, but runtime governance is intentionally holding upward distillation until review or repair conditions settleinspect_soul_growth_promotion_gateinspect whether promotable growth signals are waiting on constitutional review, observation windows, or governance repairspromotable soul-growth signals exist, but the latest active turn does not yet show reply, initiative, or strategy feedbackinspect whether the current-turn reply, initiative, and post-reply strategy chains are consuming settled soul governance outputslatest active turn already shows governed soul feedback on at least one mainline chainpersistent memory state is currently sparsesparse_persistent_memorypersistent memory stores are still sparse, so recall depth may be limited even when runtime is healthyinspect_memory_populationconfirm whether the board is freshly initialized or whether memory persistence is unexpectedly emptycontinuity_snapshot_tooling_unavailablecontinuity snapshot tooling is unavailable, which reduces repair and replay inspection depthmemory forge has recent findings or distillation candidates pending reviewinspect_memory_forgereview recent memory forge findings and distillation candidates if learning drift is suspectedinspect_continuity_snapshotThe current runtime snapshot looks generally stable.The system is running in a cautious resource state.resource pressure is elevated above normalelevated_resource_pressureresource pressure is elevated and may increase latency or defer non-critical workinspect current queues and active transport counts if latency persistsThe system is under critical resource pressure.resource pressure is currently criticalcritical_resource_pressureresource admission is in a protective state and can delay or suppress runtime workinspect resource pressure, queues, and active transports before retrying user workBeetle OS closure is not fully ready in the current runtime snapshotos_closure_not_readyone or more required runtime planes are